DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45507::$$$message_0430_0000_0000$$$::"And so, I left the legendary hidden onsen. Was the Kamurogi Hot Spring truth, or superstition? See for yourselves, dear readers..."::
45508::$$$message_0430_0000_0001$$$::"Phew. That's this month's column done... Talking about travel always helps when I'm feeling down.[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=雁夜 face=真剣 pos=center time=300] Imaginary vacations that I can take without leaving my desk are so easy. They corrupt my soul."::
45509::$$$message_0430_0000_0002$$$::"Haha... I'm such a joke, Aoi. I leave everything half-finished, no matter where I go... I've never seen a single thing through in my entire life!"::
45510::$$$message_0430_0000_0003$$$::"But I want you to believe in me. This is all so I can come see you again, because my generic hooded character design will never measure up to Tokiomi's fancy suits."::
45511::$$$message_0430_0000_0004$$$::"I'm not like him. I know he's wearing designer [font italic=true]brands[font italic=false] off the rack.[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=雁夜 face=真剣2 pos=center time=300] Damn you, Tokiomi... Trying to pass those rags off as bespoke Milano suits!"::
45512::$$$message_0430_0000_0005$$$::"I won't lose. I'll buy a two-piece suit from Blue Mountain, just you watch! With a hood, of course!"::
45513::$$$message_0430_0000_0006$$$::"Once I do, I'll get lucky, and this book I've been working on all year will become a best-seller in Japan, [wvl][hfwww layer=2]get manga and anime adaptations, and finally a Hollywood film!"::
45514::$$$message_0430_0000_0007$$$::"...I know the title [font italic=true]Shinjuku Bug[font italic=false] isn't great, but I can smell my success on the horizon!"::
45515::$$$message_0430_0000_0008$$$::"Yeah, wait for me, Aoi! I swear, I'll make you happy.[wvl][hfwww layer=2] That's what I've been saving up all this money for! I'll even write magazine columns for chump change!"::
45516::$$$message_0430_0000_0009$$$::"I know[line len=2]I'll base this mafia boss off Tokiomi.[wvl][hffgchg2 chara=雁夜 face=喜 pos=center time=300 twno=1][hfpop layer=2] He'll do a little twirl in front of his underlings and then get stabbed in the back. Kekeke..."::
45517::$$$message_0430_0000_0010$$$::"..."::
45518::$$$message_0430_0000_0011$$$::"Huh!? When did you get here, Sakura!?"::
45519::$$$message_0430_0000_0012$$$::"...Seven minutes and seventeen seconds ago. You dropped this in the hall."::
45520::$$$message_0430_0000_0013$$$::"O-oh. Sorry about that. Thanks, Sakura."::
45521::$$$message_0430_0000_0014$$$::"..."::
45522::$$$message_0430_0000_0015$$$::"..."::
45523::$$$message_0430_0000_0016$$$::"..."::
45524::$$$message_0430_0000_0017$$$::".........[wvl][hfsweat layer=0 ox=-120 oy=0].........Did you, uh, read it?"::
45525::$$$message_0430_0000_0018$$$::"You won a rookie writing award at age fourteen, and then started a business at age eighteen. Those are ideas a primary schooler would have, Uncle."::
45526::$$$message_0430_0000_0019$$$::"Guargh!"::
45527::$$$message_0430_0000_0020$$$::"Also, stop using so many first-person pronouns if you're trying to write serious Japanese literature. Grandfather said you're ruining the reader's immersion by forcing them to be aware of the speaker."::
45528::$$$message_0430_0000_0021$$$::"Guh, gah![wvl canskip=false time=400] Th-that damn geezer! Nitpicking my creative pursuits when I never asked him for advice!"::
45529::$$$message_0430_0000_0022$$$::"Hate! I hate him!"::
45530::$$$message_0430_0000_0023$$$::"I hate him for making Sakura this way, hate the editors who keep hassling me about deadlines, hate Tokiomi because he gets to eat Aoi's home cooking...!"::
45531::$$$message_0430_0000_0024$$$::"Yeah, it's all Tokiomi's fault! I have to beat him![wvl][hfwww layer=0] Or else my own life will never begin, aaaaAAAAARGH!"::
45532::$$$message_0430_0001_0000$$$::"Thud."::
45533::$$$message_0430_0001_0001$$$::"..."::
45534::$$$message_0430_0001_0002$$$::"I'm home. Dinner shopping went without a hitch. Oh, Kariya, I saw something at the shopping..."::
45535::$$$message_0430_0001_0003$$$::"He's lying face-down in a pool of blood!? That's strange... I'm not even armed this time... How did this happen?"::
45536::$$$message_0430_0001_0004$$$::"...Tokiomi syndrome, probably. It looks like he got so angry that his arteries burst."::
45537::$$$message_0430_0001_0005$$$::"The usual, then."::
45538::$$$message_0430_0001_0006$$$::"Wake up, Kariya. Kariya. Someone was handing out this flyer at the shopping district. It has valuable information on it."::
45539::$$$message_0430_0001_0007$$$::"Ugh... Berserker? Get me a blood pack and an energy drink..."::
45540::$$$message_0430_0001_0008$$$::"Here you go. Anyway, look at this flyer. I can read the words, but I don't fully understand their meaning."::
45541::$$$message_0430_0001_0009$$$::"My vision hasn't recovered yet... Sorry, Sakura. Could you read it to us?"::
45542::$$$message_0430_0001_0010$$$::"...Okay."::
45543::$$$message_0430_0001_0011$$$::"'Have you heard of the onsen that grants any wish? Visit the greatest and oldest hot spot in Fuyuki.'"::
45544::$$$message_0430_0001_0012$$$::"'But only the first visiting group's wish will come true. Be prepared should you visit us.'[wvl][hffgchg2 chara=小桜 face=楽 pos=right time=300 twno=1] That's what it says, Uncle."::
45545::$$$message_0430_0001_0013$$$::"My, how wondrous! Let us go there, Kariya!"::
45546::$$$message_0430_0001_0014$$$::"I-I dunno... It sounds like an urban legend that a third-rate reporter would come up with..."::
45547::$$$message_0430_0001_0015$$$::"If I fall for this, I'll be played for a fool and be even more of a disgrac[line len=2]"::
45548::$$$message_0430_0001_0016$$$::"..."::
45549::$$$message_0430_0001_0017$$$::(Huh!? Sakura's lonely eyes...!)::
45551::$$$message_0430_0001_0019$$$::(That's right... She's never been on a family vacation since the Matous took her in... Poor girl. Okay!)::
45552::$$$message_0430_0001_0020$$$::"Sakura, why don't we go on an onsen trip? There's nothing to be embarrassed about!"::
45553::$$$message_0430_0001_0021$$$::"..."::
45554::$$$message_0430_0001_0022$$$::"It's okay! Apparently, this onsen grants wishes when you bathe in it. I can't buy you new clothes, but with this onsen..."::
45555::$$$message_0430_0001_0023$$$::"...You can use that on yourself, Uncle. I don't have anything to wish for."::
45556::$$$message_0430_0001_0024$$$::"Kh...! That can't be true![wvl][hfwww layyer=0] Come on, Berserker. We're going to the onsen, all three of us!"::
45557::$$$message_0430_0001_0025$$$::"Sakura is coming along? But Kariya, this flyer went out to the other Masters, as well."::
45558::$$$message_0430_0001_0026$$$::"We won't be able to avoid fighting them on the way. It would put Sakura in danger..."::
45559::$$$message_0430_0001_0027$$$::"I'll protect Sakura! I may not be able to get the Holy Grail, but an onsen, on the other hand... I swear I'll win this war, at least!"::
45560::$$$message_0430_0001_0028$$$::"You can rest easy and follow me![wvl][hfwww layyer=0] I'm the best at hanafuda!"::
45561::$$$message_0430_0001_0029$$$::"Ahh, he left without even making any preparations... What a troubled man. Oh, well. Shall we follow him, Sakura?"::
45562::$$$message_0430_0001_0030$$$::"...Okay. He's just spinning his wheels like always, but we can't let him go by himself."::
�